{"seq":33,"slug":"technical-debt-quantification","title":"技术债量化与治理","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification","rating":{"composite":4.26,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"技术债量化与治理\">技术债量化与治理</h1><p>技术债不是比喻的诗意——它是可以被测量、被定价、被偿还的工程现实。Cunningham 1992 年首创这个隐喻时，强调的是「做出有意识的权衡」；Fowler 2009 年扩展出四象限，将「无意识的鲁莽」与「深思熟虑的谨慎」区分开来。本 hub 的核心命题是：<strong>技术债必须量化才能被治理</strong>。凭感觉说「代码很乱」无法争取预算；用数字说「每次功能迭代多花 3.2 个工程日」才能推动决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦<strong>量化方法与工程治理</strong>——如何用数字描述债务、如何设计防止债务堆积的工程机制。相邻 hub 的分工如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>侧重点</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>技术债管理与治理（25_technical-debt-management / 29_technical-debt-governance）</td>\n<td>管理概述、债务来源分类、团队文化</td>\n<td>本 hub 深入量化工具与指标；管理和治理 hub 偏战略与文化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码重构与遗留系统（00_cs/code-refactoring-legacy）</td>\n<td>重构手法、安全重构模式、遗留代码策略</td>\n<td>本 hub 关注重构的<strong>预算分配</strong>与<strong>ROI</strong>；重构 hub 关注<strong>怎么改</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软件工程基础（00_cs/software-engineering-fundamentals）</td>\n<td>工程原则、设计模式、SOLID</td>\n<td>本 hub 将工程原则落地到<strong>可测量的质量指标</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本 hub 不重复讲「什么是技术债」的基础定义，而是直接进入量化建模和工程治理机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节结构\">章节结构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1_foundations   — 概念框架与理论基础（技术债隐喻、利息/本金模型、生命周期）&#10;2_measurement   — 量化工具与指标（静态分析、适应度函数、生产力影响）&#10;3_management    — 治理策略（优先级框架、重构预算、预防实践）&#10;4_organization  — 组织落地（债务登记、干系人沟通、持续改善）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1_foundations   — 概念框架与理论基础（技术债隐喻、利息/本金模型、生命周期）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2_measurement   — 量化工具与指标（静态分析、适应度函数、生产力影响）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3_management    — 治理策略（优先级框架、重构预算、预防实践）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4_organization  — 组织落地（债务登记、干系人沟通、持续改善）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p><strong>初次接触技术债量化的读者</strong>：按章节顺序 1→2→3→4 阅读，建立从概念到实践的完整认知链。</p>\n<p><strong>已有债务管理经验、想引入量化工具的工程师</strong>：直接从第 2 章开始，重点阅读静态分析指标与适应度函数；然后跳到第 3 章的优先级框架。</p>\n<p><strong>技术负责人 / 架构师</strong>：重点阅读第 3 章（重构预算）和第 4 章（干系人沟通），关注如何将量化数据转化为组织决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的软件工程经验（理解代码质量、代码审查、重构的基本概念）</li>\n<li>了解版本控制工作流（git 日常操作）</li>\n<li>熟悉主流静态分析工具的基本使用（SonarQube 或类似工具）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>本 hub 以量化与工程机制为核心。读完后，如果想深入文化变革与团队实践，可参考技术债管理 hub；如果想学习具体重构手法，可参考代码重构与遗留系统 hub。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"概念框架与理论基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tech-debt-metaphor-taxonomy","title":"技术债隐喻与 Fowler 四象限","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/foundations/tech-debt-metaphor-taxonomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"interest-principal-model","title":"利息与本金模型：债务成本的量化框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/foundations/interest-principal-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tech-debt-lifecycle","title":"技术债生命周期：从产生到偿还的完整链路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/foundations/tech-debt-lifecycle"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"measurement","title":"量化方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"static-analysis-metrics","title":"静态分析指标：用数字描述代码质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement/static-analysis-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"architectural-fitness-functions","title":"架构适应度函数：让架构约束变成可执行的测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement/architectural-fitness-functions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-productivity-impact","title":"开发者生产力影响：SPACE 框架与 DORA 指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/measurement/developer-productivity-impact"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"management","title":"治理策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prioritization-framework","title":"技术债优先级框架：WSJF 与 Cost-of-Delay","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/management/prioritization-framework"},{"seq":2,"slug":"refactoring-budget","title":"重构预算与偿还策略：20% 时间与 Boy Scout Rule","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/management/refactoring-budget"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prevention-practices","title":"预防实践：让质量要求成为工程默认值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/management/prevention-practices"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"organization","title":"组织实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/organization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"debt-registry-tracking","title":"债务登记与追踪：技术债的可见性工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/organization/debt-registry-tracking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stakeholder-communication","title":"干系人沟通：用业务语言讲技术债","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/organization/stakeholder-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-improvement","title":"持续改善：Kaizen、Tech Health Review 与技术健康评分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/technical-debt-quantification/organization/continuous-improvement"}]}]}